<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>
<% content_for :description, "How Buy My Pokes collects, uses, and protects your information." %>

<div class="container mt-4 mb-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-muted">Last updated: <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></p>

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how Buy My Pokes ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and
    shares information when you use our website and services (the "Service").
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information:</strong> name, username, and email address you provide when you register.</li>
    <li><strong>Order information:</strong> the products you purchase, order totals, and order history.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> we do not store your card details. Payments are processed by
      <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe</a>, which collects and
      processes your payment information directly under its own privacy policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> basic technical information such as IP address, browser type, and pages
      visited, collected automatically via cookies and similar technologies (see our Cookie Policy below).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">How We Use Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To create and manage your account.</li>
    <li>To process orders and payments, and to communicate with you about them.</li>
    <li>To maintain the security and integrity of the Service.</li>
    <li>To improve the Service and understand how it is used.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use cookies that are strictly necessary for the Service to function, such as keeping you signed in
    and remembering the contents of your shopping cart. If analytics are enabled, we may also use cookies
    to understand how visitors use the Service. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Sharing of Information</h2>
  <p>
    We share information with service providers who help us operate the Service, primarily Stripe for
    payment processing. We do not sell your personal information. We may disclose information if required
    to by law.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain account and order information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide
    the Service, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your Rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may access, update, or delete your account information at any time from your profile, or by
    contacting us at <a href="mailto:orders@example.com">orders@example.com</a>. Depending on where you
    live, you may have additional rights regarding your personal information under applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The Service is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information
    from children under 13.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on this page with
    a new "Last updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this Privacy Policy? Email us at
    <a href="mailto:orders@example.com">orders@example.com</a>.
  </p>
</div>
